# Place ONNX model files here:
#   - genai_config.json
#   - config.json
#   - tokenizer.json
#   - tokenizer_config.json
#   - special_tokens_map.json
#   - vocab.json / merges.txt (if needed by tokenizer)
#   - onnx/
#       - model.onnx (or model_q4.onnx, etc. -- point genai_config to whichever one)
#
# Set EVENT_MODEL_PATH env var to point to a different directory if needed.
